                        <h2 class="mb-4">About Us</h2>
                        <p>At Mi Cusina, we believe food is more than just a meal — it’s an experience meant to be shared. Our restaurant was created to bring people together through delicious dishes inspired by Filipino flavors and crafted with care.
                        We take pride in serving fresh ingredients, offering a welcoming atmosphere, and ensuring every guest feels at home. Whether you’re here for a casual bite, a family gathering, or a special occasion, Mi Cusina is your place to enjoy good food and great company. 
                        <br><br>Mi Cusina began with a simple vision: to create a dining space where tradition meets innovation. Rooted in the rich culinary heritage of the Philippines, we blend classic recipes with modern touches to bring out flavors that feel both familiar and exciting. Every dish tells a story of culture, community, and passion for food.</p>
                        <p>At Mi Cusina, we envision a restaurant that grows with its community. By embracing technology, sustainability, and customer feedback, we aim to continuously improve and adapt to the needs of our guests. Our goal is to be more than a restaurant — to be a trusted place where people gather, celebrate, and feel at home.</p>
